        "content": "What function calculates the cumulative Volume Price Trend (VPT) for a stock from sequential daily prices and trading volumes, using the formula VPT_t = VPT_{t-1} + volume_t × (price_t − price_{t-1}) / price_{t-1}, and returns the final value rounded to two decimal places?",
