      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    prices = [120, 123, 121, 125, 130]\n    volumes = [1500, 1600, 1550, 1700, 1800]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    vpt = [0]\n    for i in range(1, len(prices)):\n        price_change = (prices[i] - prices[i - 1]) / prices[i - 1]\n        vpt.append(vpt[i - 1] + price_change * volumes[i])\n\n    answer = round(vpt[-1], 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
